 proxygen  coro testing proxygen proxygen  coro  test   
 
co test p x httpclienttests  basicupstream    
  httpcoroconnector  connectionparams connparams  
  httpcoroconnector  sessionparams sessparams sess   co await httpcoroconnector  connect  
       evb   serveraddress   std  chrono  seconds 1   connparams  sessparams   
 
  mockhttphandler handler  
  httpstreamsourceupstreamsink serversink  
       evb   sess- acquirekeepalive     handler   
 
  handler expectheaders    
  handler expecteom    
  handler expectdetachtransaction req   getgetrequest    
  serversink sendheaderswitheom req   
  co await serversink transact sess   sess- reserverequest     
  
 
co test p x httpclienttests  upstreampausebeforeeom    
  httpcoroconnector  connectionparams connparams  
  httpcoroconnector  sessionparams sessparams sess   co await httpcoroconnector  connect  
       evb   serveraddress   std  chrono  seconds 1   connparams  sessparams   
 
  mockhttphandler handler  
  httpstreamsourceupstreamsink serversink  
       evb   sess- acquirekeepalive     handler   
 
  handler expectheaders   serversink    serversink pauseingress req   getgetrequest    
  serversink sendheaderswitheom req   
  co withexecutor  
      co await folly  coro  co current executor  
      folly  coro  co invoke  
            serversink   handler    -  folly  coro  task co await folly  coro  sleep std  chrono  milliseconds 100    
            handler expecteom    
            handler expectdetachtransaction    
            serversink resumeingress    
              
       start    
  co await serversink transact sess   sess- reserverequest     
  
 
co test p x httpclienttests  failsendupstreamreq    
  httpcoroconnector  connectionparams connparams  
  httpcoroconnector  sessionparams sessparams sess   co await httpcoroconnector  connect  
       evb   serveraddress   std  chrono  seconds 1   connparams  sessparams reservation   sess- reserverequest    
  xcheck reservation hasvalue     
    
    
  sess- initiatedrain handler mockhttphandler    
  httpstreamsourceupstreamsink serversink  
       evb   sess- acquirekeepalive    handler req   getgetrequest    
  serversink sendheaders req   
 
  expect call  handler   onerror     times 1   
  expect call  handler   detachtransaction    willonce  handler handler  
      
 
  co await serversink transact sess  std  move  reservation    
  
 
co test p x httpclienttests  postwithpause    
  httpcoroconnector  connectionparams connparams  
  httpcoroconnector  sessionparams sessparams sess   co await httpcoroconnector  connect  
       evb   serveraddress   std  chrono  seconds 1   connparams  sessparams   
 
  mockhttphandler handler  
  httpstreamsourceupstreamsink serversink  
       evb   sess- acquirekeepalive     handler length   65535 req   getpostrequest length   1   
    
  serversink sendheaders req   
  serversink sendpadding 2   
  handler expectegresspaused    
  serversink sendbody makebuf length    
  handler expectegressresumed       
    serversink sendpadding 10101   
    serversink sendbody makebuf 1    
    serversink sendpadding 12345   
    serversink sendeom    
      
 
  serversink pauseingress    
  evb  runafterdelay  
            
        serversink resumeingress    
        handler expectheaders    
        expect call handler   onbody      
        handler expecteom    
        handler expectdetachtransaction    
         
      50   
  co await serversink transact sess   sess- reserverequest     
  
 
co test p x httpclienttests  sendabortduringpause    
  httpcoroconnector  connectionparams connparams  
  httpcoroconnector  sessionparams sessparams sess   co await httpcoroconnector  connect  
       evb   serveraddress   std  chrono  seconds 1   connparams  sessparams   
 
  mockhttphandler handler  
  httpstreamsourceupstreamsink serversink  
       evb   sess- acquirekeepalive     handler   
    
  evb  runafterdelay       serversink sendabort       50   
 
  handler expectheaders         
      
    serversink pauseingress    
      
 
  folly  coro  baton waitfordetach  
  handler expectdetachtransaction         waitfordetach post length   65535 req   getpostrequest length   
  serversink sendheaders req   
  serversink sendbody makebuf length    
  co await co awaittry serversink transact sess   sess- reserverequest      
  co await waitfordetach  
  
 
co test p x httpclienttests  detachandabortifincomplete    
  httpcoroconnector  connectionparams connparams  
  httpcoroconnector  sessionparams sessparams sess   co await httpcoroconnector  connect  
       evb   serveraddress   std  chrono  seconds 1   connparams  sessparams   
 
  strictmock mockhttphandler  handler serversink   std  make unique httpstreamsourceupstreamsink   
       evb   sess- acquirekeepalive     handler   
 
  folly  coro  baton waituntilheaders  
  handler expectheaders         
      
    serversink- pauseingress sinkptr   serversink sinkptr- detachandabortifincomplete std  move serversink    
 
    waituntilheaders post length   65535 req   getpostrequest length   
  serversink- sendheaders req   
 
  expect call handler   onegresspaused     
  serversink- sendbody makebuf length    
 
  expect call handler   onegressresumed     
  co await co awaittry serversink- transact sess   sess- reserverequest      
 
  co await waituntilheaders  
  
 
instantiate test suite p httpclienttests  
                         httpclienttests  
                         values transporttype  tcp   
                         transporttypetotestname   
 
     proxygen lib http coro test httpstreamsourcesinktests